      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "The word turns back and forth on an Oscillator through Rotate, over a clear background. Under it is the Output's own last frame, zoomed in a little and dimmed with a hue step, so every frame leaves an echo that grows outward and changes color. Try the Zoom below 1 to pull the echoes inward, or Value nearer 1 for longer trails."
        }
      },
